# Epic Fight: "Choose one or both - Double target creature's power and toughness until end of turn; Target creature you control
# fights target creature an opponent controls." Bot1 chooses both: its Grizzly Bears (2/2) is doubled to 4/4 first (the modes are
# done in printed order, CR 700.2d), then fights Bot2's Centaur Courser (3/3): the Bears deal 4 and kill it, taking 3 and living
# on as a 4/4 (a 2/2 Bears would have died), so it is the doubled power and toughness that fight.

